Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 23:51:25 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 64/66] Doric's Quest

New quest on OpenRune's quest framework. Progress is varp 31 (doricquest)
through a server-only varbit: 0, 10 started, 100 complete, the values the
OSRS client and Quest Helper read. Dialogue follows the OSRS Wiki
transcript: the opening topics, the start (with a bronze pickaxe), the
6 clay / 4 copper ore / 2 iron ore hand-in (one transaction), and the
shortcut when the player already carries them. Rewards: 1 QP, 1,300
Mining XP, 180 coins. Until the quest is done, Smith on Doric's anvils
brings Doric over instead (LocOpOverrides from the treasure trails patch).

The quest start prompt reads "Start Doric's Quest?" for names that end
in "Quest" (as in OSRS), "Start the X quest?" otherwise.

Guesses: the journal text, the after-quest talk, the split of the long
start line into two boxes, the quest scroll item.
Needs 12 (QuestTalkFixture) and 21 (LocOpOverrides).
